-- title:
--   Base change of the integral closure along a map of constants
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ be a commutative integral domain with fraction field $K_0$, let $F_0$ be an intermediate field of the Laurent series field $K_0(\!(q)\!)$ over $K_0$, equipped with an $R$-algebra structure making $R \to K_0 \to F_0$ a scalar tower, and let $x \in F_0$ be such that $F_0$ is algebraic over the subfield $K_0(x)$ generated by $x$ over $K_0$. Write $B =$ `chartAlg R F₀ {x}` for the subalgebra of $F_0$ consisting of the elements integral over the $R$-subalgebra generated by $x$, and assume $B$ is flat as an $R$-module. Let $L$ be a field, $i : K_0 \to L$ a ring homomorphism, and $K'$ an intermediate field of $L(\!(q)\!)$ over $L$ with $K'$ equal to the subfield generated over $L$ by the coefficientwise images $\mathrm{coeffMap}\,i$ of the elements of $F_0$. Let $A$ be a commutative integral domain with fraction field $L$, carrying an $R$-algebra structure compatible with $i$ in the sense that $\mathrm{alg}_{A \to L}(\mathrm{alg}_{R \to A}(r)) = i(\mathrm{alg}_{R \to K_0}(r))$ for all $r \in R$, and acting on $K'$ through $L$. Let $x' \in K'$ be an element whose image in $L(\!(q)\!)$ is the coefficientwise image of $x$ under $i$. Assume that $A \otimes_R B$ is an integral domain and is integrally closed. Then there is an isomorphism of $A$-algebras $e : A \otimes_R B \to$ `chartAlg A K' {x'}`, the latter being the subalgebra of $K'$ of elements integral over the $A$-subalgebra generated by $x'$, such that for every $b \in B$ the Laurent series in $L$ underlying $e(1 \otimes b)$ is the coefficientwise image under $i$ of the Laurent series underlying $b$.
--
--   This is the statement that forming the integral closure of $R[x]$ in $F_0$ commutes with base change of the field of constants, under the hypothesis that the base-changed algebra is already an integrally closed domain; the normalising condition on the isomorphism is that it act coefficientwise on Laurent expansions. It is used in the construction of the affine charts of full-level modular curves after base change of constants, in [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevelOne.exists_chartAlgFin_tensorProduct_ringEquiv_of_cyclotomicConstants_of_isAlgClosed_of_isPrimitiveRoot_mul_of_dvd`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevelOne.exists_chartAlgFin_tensorProduct_ringEquiv_of_cyclotomicConstants_of_isAlgClosed_of_isPrimitiveRoot_mul_of_dvd) and [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_chartAlgFin_tensorProduct_ringEquiv_of_cyclotomicConstants_of_isAlgClosed`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_chartAlgFin_tensorProduct_ringEquiv_of_cyclotomicConstants_of_isAlgClosed).
